  "description": "StockTok Positions Update + A WARNING FOR AISP",
  "body_html": "<p> Watch the video… </p><p>But a quick summary, Bright Springs Health and Global Star are both well into profit, over 16% each. We will talk about dollar cost averaging UP ⬆️ when and if those stocks continue their trends and have further breakouts. CVR Energy (a recession resistant stock) and iShares Russell 2000 are just consolidating. No concerns there…for now. Airship AI is our bag of ass at the moment. This started off as a small position due to the company being a penny stock. </p><h4>FULL DISCLOSURE FOR AISP:</h4><ul><li><p>I am gambling earnings!  Earnings are a gamble! 🎲</p></li><li><p>The stock can plummet…even if it has good earnings! The stock could shoot up a huge percentage as well, after a bad earnings. <em><strong>ANYTHING CAN HAPPEN</strong></em>. Earnings are a catalyst for huge moves during post-market. </p></li><li><p>You can gamble. You can cut the position. You can trim the position. <em><strong>Do whatever is best for you! </strong></em></p></li></ul><h4>YOU HAVE BEEN WARNED! ⚠️ </h4><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-on-my-radar-to-buy/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-on-my-radar-to-buy/comments\"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p><p>This stock, we traded previously for a small profit of nearly 4%. However, I expected a much larger run…before the news and government went wild around September 30th. This stock recently had a break out, and I have a <em><strong>stop limit buy order</strong></em>. The original article for this stock can be <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-croissant-alert\">found here</a>. The stock is: </p>",
